{"id":"e948c25f4a467fa1","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-logical-axiom.md","title":"Logical Axiom","display":"df-logical-axiom — Logical Axiom","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-logical-axiom","aliases":["92-df-logical-axiom"],"display":"df-logical-axiom — Logical Axiom","depends_on":["[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-propositional-axiom]]","[[92-df-substitution]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","[[92-df-term]]","[[92-df-signature]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-logical-axiom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-logical-axiom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-logical-axiom — Logical Axiom"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b2016a44e2de38ce\" href=\"?note=b2016a44e2de38ce\" title=\"92-df-propositional-axiom\">92-df-propositional-axiom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4ef6f65f207e8439\" href=\"?note=4ef6f65f207e8439\" title=\"92-df-term\">92-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formulas, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t,s_1,t_1,s_2,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\">\\(s,t,s_1,t_1,s_2,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\\)</span> (terms, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4ef6f65f207e8439\" href=\"?note=4ef6f65f207e8439\" title=\"92-df-term\">92-df-term</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> (variable symbol, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PropAx}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{PropAx}_G\\)</span> (propositional axiom set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b2016a44e2de38ce\" href=\"?note=b2016a44e2de38ce\" title=\"92-df-propositional-axiom\">92-df-propositional-axiom</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\)</span> (capture-avoiding substitution, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span> (free-variable function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\\)</span> (definition-target logical-axiom set)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logical\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\mathrm{PropAx}_G\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\to\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,t,x)\n\\mid x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G,\\ t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G,\\ \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\forall x(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\to(\\varphi\\to\\forall x\\,\\psi)\n\\mid \\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G,\\ x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\exists x\\,\\varphi\\to\\neg\\forall x\\,\\neg\\varphi,\n\\quad\\neg\\forall x\\,\\neg\\varphi\\to\\exists x\\,\\varphi\n\\mid \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{t=t\\mid t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{s=t\\to S(s)=S(t)\\mid s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{s_1=t_1\\to(s_2=t_2\\to s_1+s_2=t_1+t_2)\n\\mid s_1,t_1,s_2,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{s_1=t_1\\to(s_2=t_2\\to s_1\\cdot s_2=t_1\\cdot t_2)\n\\mid s_1,t_1,s_2,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{s_1=t_1\\to(s_2=t_2\\to((s_1=s_2)\\to(t_1=t_2)))\n\\mid s_1,t_1,s_2,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logical\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\mathrm{PropAx}_G\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\to\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,t,x)\n\\mid x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G,\\ t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G,\\ \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\forall x(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\to(\\varphi\\to\\forall x\\,\\psi)\n\\mid \\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G,\\ x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\exists x\\,\\varphi\\to\\neg\\forall x\\,\\neg\\varphi,\n\\quad\\neg\\forall x\\,\\neg\\varphi\\to\\exists x\\,\\varphi\n\\mid \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{t=t\\mid t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{s=t\\to S(s)=S(t)\\mid s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{s_1=t_1\\to(s_2=t_2\\to s_1+s_2=t_1+t_2)\n\\mid s_1,t_1,s_2,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{s_1=t_1\\to(s_2=t_2\\to s_1\\cdot s_2=t_1\\cdot t_2)\n\\mid s_1,t_1,s_2,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{s_1=t_1\\to(s_2=t_2\\to((s_1=s_2)\\to(t_1=t_2)))\n\\mid s_1,t_1,s_2,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>逻辑公理：在所有结构中为真的公理</li>\n<li>包括命题公理（重言式模式）</li>\n<li>包括量词公理（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\;\\varphi(x) \\to \\varphi(t)\">\\(\\forall x\\;\\varphi(x) \\to \\varphi(t)\\)</span>）</li>\n<li>因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists\">\\(\\exists\\)</span> 是本语言的原始 token，另以两个蕴涵模式明确规定\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x\\,\\varphi\">\\(\\exists x\\,\\varphi\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\forall x\\,\\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\neg\\forall x\\,\\neg\\varphi\\)</span> 的对偶关系</li>\n<li>包括等式反身性以及本固定签名中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,+,\\cdot,=\">\\(S,+,\\cdot,=\\)</span> 的合同模式；它们给出等式对全部原子公式的代入性</li>\n<li>逻辑公理与非逻辑公理的区分</li>\n<li>非逻辑公理：理论特有的公理（如PA公理）</li>\n<li>相对于本书固定且可有效编码的签名、公式和无捕获代换，这个逻辑公理集的成员关系是可判定且可取为原始递归的</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-propositional-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"b2016a44e2de38ce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-propositional-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"725c1f1651ce9a00","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"",